{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0176_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_chat_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "fb6f4893a409381c87dae08e0b048100ee0967840091caba9ab76914a4827524", "ja": "あれ？　なんだか、ズンズンって\n音がするけど……。どこから\n聞こえてくるんだろう？", "zh": "咦？总觉得有“咚咚”的声音……是从哪里传来的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0176_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_chat_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "42a82cafee3e4bbcba45a737da957b06cecc991dd82944c5853df3a9df7bc9bf", "ja": "ズンズン？　ブンブン？\nヘイYO！　みたいな……\nこういうの、なんていうんだっけ。", "zh": "咚咚？嗡嗡？\n像“嘿，哟！”这种……\n这种该叫什么来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0176_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "6fe27e3de1ae72e27df3bbe561c8efbced8e06c064526652327c359b6456dd0a", "ja": "リズムに合わせて、自分の\n言いたいことを言うような……\nう～ん、思い出せないなぁ。", "zh": "随着节奏说出自己想说的话……\n嗯～我怎么想不起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0176_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0176_story_chat_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "6a7a40fb9dec6b92720b495a4447e7351a56405a6083c21b8696b0eab700f7c1", "ja": "あ、いけない！　そういえば、\n{$P$}Pさんに\n用事があるんだった！", "zh": "啊，不好！说起来，我还有事要找{$P$}P先生呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
